      "text": "2. The legislative proposals which are submitted will be reviewed by the Mayor's Legislative Coordinating Committee and the various departments and agencies will thereafter be notified as to which proposals are acceptable as part of the City's program. When necessary, representatives of the affected City agencies will meet with the Legislative Coordinating Committee prior to any policy decision by the Committee. The notice to the various departments and agencies will also contain further information relating to the pre-filing procedure.",
